{"hw":"σελήνη","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">σελήνη</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">σελήν-η</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Dor.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">σελάνα</span> <span class=\"gk\">[λα]</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">O.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.75</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Aeol.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">σελάννα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Sapph.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">53</span> </span>; cf. also <span class=\"gk\">σεληναίη</span>:—<div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">the moon</b>, <span class=\"gk\">ς. πλήθουσα</span> the full-<b class=\"lex-tr\">moon</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18.484</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ς. ἀεξομένη, ὀλίγη κεράεσσι</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arat.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">780</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">733</span> </span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">a moon's breadth</b>, measure used by early astronomers, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ptol.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Alm.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.10</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">νουμηνία κατὰ σελήνην</span>, i.e. by the <b class=\"lex-tr\">lunar</b> month, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.28</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">SIG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">683.44</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\